{
  "name": "Actions",
  "description": "What we will do about a key result that is off: the cause, the plan, an owner and a date.",
  "position": 3,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "plan-recovery",
      "label": {
        "en": "Propose a recovery plan for a red key result",
        "zh-CN": "为一个红灯关键结果提出补救方案"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-okr` skill in this folder and follow it. For the key result I name, read its check-ins and evidence, explain in two or three sentences why it is off, and add one action with a concrete plan, an owner and a due date. Ask me who owns it if the key result has no owner.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-okr` Skill，按它的规则做。针对我说的关键结果，读它的进展记录和依据，用两三句话说明为什么偏离，然后加一条行动，写清具体计划、负责人和截止日期。关键结果没有负责人时先问我。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "chase-actions",
      "label": {
        "en": "Which actions are overdue?",
        "zh-CN": "哪些行动已经超期"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-okr` skill in this folder and follow it. List open actions past their due date with their owner and key result, and say whether that key result has moved since the action was opened. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-okr` Skill，按它的规则做。列出超过截止日期仍未完成的行动、负责人和对应关键结果，并说明行动开出以后这个关键结果有没有变化。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
